# The mean machine. cow scopes weight to 400 500 600 900, whose prefix means are integral on
# purpose (the harness compares within 1e-9). none is the empty scope: the mean declares no
# empty result and yields no row; the count declares 0.
n 6
col cow bool 1 1 0 1 1 0
col weight num 400 500 50 600 900 70
col none bool 0 0 0 0 0 0
ja 牛 cow
ja 重量 weight
ja 無 none
